H7014B.def:
A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Genèse 4:1; 
son of: Adam (H0121) and Eve (H2332); 
brother of: Abel (H1893) and Seth (H8352); 
father of: Enoch (H2585)
Also named: Kain (Κάϊν "Cain" G2535)
§ Cain = "possession"
eldest son of Adam and Eve and the first murderer having murdered his brother

H7018.def:
A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Genèse 5:9; 
son of: Enosh (H0583); 
father of: Mahalalel (H4111); also called Cainan at Luc 3:37; 
Also named: Kainan, Kainam (Καϊνάν, Καϊνάμ "Cainan" G2536H) 
§ Kenan = "possession"
1) son of Enosh and father of Mahalaleel
1a) also 'Cainan'

H7027H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 23:21; 
son of: Mahli (H4249); 
brother of: Libni (H3845H) and Eleazar (H0499J); 
father of: Jerahmeel (H3396H)
§ Kish = "bent"
1) a Benjamite of the family of Matri, father of king Saul
2) an ancestor of Mordecai
3) son of Gibeon and brother of Abdon, Zur, Baal, Ner, Nadab, Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah, and Mikloth; uncle of Kish the father of king Saul
4) a Merarite Levite, son of Mahli and grandson of Merari the progenitor of the family
5) a Merarite Levite, son of Abdi in the time of king Hezekiah of Judah

H7029.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:44; 
son of: Abdi (H5660); 
father of: Jeduthun (H3038); also called Kushaiah at 1 Chroniques 15:17; 
Also named: qu.sha.ya.hu (קוּשָׁיָ֫הוּ "Kushaiah" H6984) 
§ Kishi = "bow of Jehovah"
a Merarite Levite, father or ancestor of Ethan the minstrel in the time of David

H7055G.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Genèse 22:21; 
son of: Nahor (H5152H) and Milcah (H4435); 
brother of: Uz (H5780H), Buz (H0938), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044) and Bethuel (H1328A); 
half-brother of: Tebah (H2875), Gaham (H1514), Tahash (H8477) and Maacah (H4601); 
father of: Aram (H0758H)
§ Kemuel = "raised of God"
1) son of Nahor by Milcah and father of Aram
2) son of Shiphtan, prince of the tribe of Ephraim, and one of the 12 men selected to apportion the promised land between the tribes
3) Levite, father of Hashabiah, prince of the tribe in the time of David

H7073G.def:
A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:11; 
son of: Eliphaz (H0464); 
brother of: Teman (H8487), Omar (H0201), Zepho (H6825), Gatam (H1609), Amalek (H6002H) and Korah (H7141H)
§ Kenaz = "hunter"
1) son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau; one of the dukes of Edom
2) a brother of Caleb and father of Othniel

H7073I.def:
A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 32:12; 
son of: Jephunneh (H3312); 
brother of: Caleb (H3612); 
father of: Othniel (H6274) and Seraiah (H8304J); also called Kenizzite at Nombres 32:12; 1x,14;
Also named: qe.niz.zi (קְנִזִּי "Kenizzite" H7074H)
§ Kenaz = "hunter"
1) son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau; one of the dukes of Edom
2) a brother of Caleb and father of Othniel

H7074H.def:
Someone descended from Kenaz who was a man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 32:12; 
son of: Jephunneh (H3312); 
brother of: Caleb (H3612); 
father of: Othniel (H6274) and Seraiah (H8304J); also called Kenizzite at Nombres 32:12; 1x,14;
Group of qe.naz (קְנַז "Kenaz" H7073I)
§ Kenezite or Kenizzites = "descendant of Kenaz"
descendants of Kenaz
